<urn:usf:architecture-conformance-disposition:assurance-evidence-missing> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "A requirement declares a rule no procedure implements, or a required assurance set produced no verdict at all. This is not a failure and it is emphatically not a pass: nothing was measured." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
