<urn:usf:architecture-conformance-disposition:assurance-scope-unsatisfied> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "The requirement is decidable only at a scope the observation did not cover. Reporting a pass here would be vacuous and reporting a failure would blame the confinement rather than the code." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
