<urn:usf:architecture:1> <urn:usf:predicate:styleRule> "Assurance code observes the architecture and must never become something the architecture depends on." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
<urn:usf:architecture:1> <urn:usf:predicate:styleRule> "Every direction between layers is declared. A direction that is neither permitted nor forbidden does not exist, and an import that takes one is a finding rather than a discovery about the architecture." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
<urn:usf:architecture:1> <urn:usf:predicate:styleRule> "Product implementation is realised beneath its own root and is judged by the profile that owns it, never by the foundation." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
