<urn:usf:cycle-policy:foundation:1> <urn:usf:predicate:cycleExceptionReason> "Fourteen units sit in import cycles today, all of them on the work derivation and realisation seam where a packet stage is computed from state the same modules produce. The exception is measured debt, enumerated so that it cannot grow silently: a cycle reaching any unit outside this set is a violation, and removing a member from a cycle needs no permission because the exception is a ceiling rather than a floor." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
<urn:usf:cycle-policy:foundation:1> <urn:usf:predicate:cyclePolicyScope> "Every judged implementation unit in the declared population." <urn:usf:graph:architecture-conformance> .
